  prompt: Inspect
  id: marsh_drawings
  title: The children's drawings
  text: 'Crayon drawings taped to the wall: Mama, Daddy, four kids, the house. In every one since September there''s a fifth grown-up standing a little behind the others, in grey. In the newest, it''s holding Mama''s hand.'
  subject: June Marsh
  customPrompt: Look at the drawings
  nerveShock: 0
  awareness: 0
