  prompt: Look through the files
  description: 'Doc''s surgery files, forty years of the town in carbon copies. One folder has been put back facing the wrong way: every birth he recorded in 1945, the year the Founders'' Day pageant started. The pages are soft, as if somebody has read them over and over.'
